fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"va/vah265enc.html#vah265enc:qpi","fragment":"\n\tqpi\n\nThe quantizer value for I frame. In CQP mode, it specifies the QP of\nI frame, in other mode, it specifies the init QP of all frames.\n\n\tFlags :\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\tRead\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t/\t\t\n\t\t\t\tWrite\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t/\t\t\n\t\t\t\tConstruct\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\tDefault value :\t26\n\n"});